WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.000
Main har business owner ke saath kaam nahi karta.

00:00:02.000 --> 00:00:06.000
Shikha Solutions un business owners ke saath kaam karta hai

00:00:06.000 --> 00:00:11.000
jinke paas vision hai, business chal raha hai, but execution mein gap hai.

00:00:11.000 --> 00:00:15.000
Founder ke dimaag mein clarity hai, but woh clarity team tak nahi jaati.

00:00:15.000 --> 00:00:18.000
Sales ho rahi hai, but proper follow-up system nahi hai.

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:21.000
Team hai, but ownership koi nahi leta.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.000
Business grow ho raha hai, but owner free nahi ho raha.

00:00:25.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Main un founders ke saath kaam karta hoon jo seriously apne employees, sales, systems

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
aur execution ke through apne business ko stronger banana chahte hain.

00:00:34.000 --> 00:00:37.000
Agar aap sirf advice chahte ho, toh main right fit nahi.

00:00:37.000 --> 00:00:40.000
Agar aap execution partner chahte ho, then we should talk.

00:00:40.000 --> 00:00:43.000
